{"id":"3315c3af8b987983","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-riemann-mapping.md","title":"Riemann Mapping","display":"df-riemann-mapping — Riemann Mapping","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-riemann-mapping","aliases":["58-df-riemann-mapping","Riemann Mapping"],"display":"df-riemann-mapping — Riemann Mapping","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-open-set.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-connected.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-simply-connected.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-riemann-mapping"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-riemann-mapping</span><span>Riemann Mapping</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-riemann-mapping — Riemann Mapping"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d06636b21adf739\" href=\"?note=2d06636b21adf739\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md\">../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c664c247a9331632\" href=\"?note=c664c247a9331632\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-open-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-open-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71801f5b9407391a\" href=\"?note=71801f5b9407391a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-connected.md\">../batch10/58-df-connected.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"78e4218bb3804257\" href=\"?note=78e4218bb3804257\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-simply-connected.md\">../batch18/58-df-simply-connected.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,f,g,\\alpha,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},\\tau_{\\mathbb D},\\tau_\\Omega\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,f,g,\\alpha,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},\\tau_{\\mathbb D},\\tau_\\Omega\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb C\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb D\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|&lt;1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb D\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z|&lt;1\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Open}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Open}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connected}_S,\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Connected}_S,\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see the cited topology atoms)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, with order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\">\\((f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2d06636b21adf739\" href=\"?note=2d06636b21adf739\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md\">../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DiskAutomorphism}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{DiskAutomorphism}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SameRiemannMapClass}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SameRiemannMapClass}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{std}\">\\(\\mathrm{std}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n(|w-z|&lt;r\\to w\\in U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{\\mathbb C}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n(|w-z|&lt;r\\to w\\in U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}subspace} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_Y,Y,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\leftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\land\\tau_Y=\\{U\\cap Y:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}subspace} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_Y,Y,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\leftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\land\\tau_Y=\\{U\\cap Y:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S(f,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb D},\\tau_\\Omega\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb D},\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_\\Omega,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\mathrm{Open}_S(\\Omega,\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Omega\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\Omega\\neq\\mathbb C\n\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S(f,\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb D},1,\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega,1)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S(f,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb D},\\tau_\\Omega\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb D},\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_\\Omega,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\mathrm{Open}_S(\\Omega,\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Omega\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\Omega\\neq\\mathbb C\n\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S(f,\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb D},1,\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega,1)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}automorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DiskAutomorphism}_S(\\alpha,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb D}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb D},\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S(\\alpha,\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb D},1,\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb D},1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}automorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DiskAutomorphism}_S(\\alpha,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\tau_{\\mathbb D}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb D},\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S(\\alpha,\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb D},1,\\mathbb D,\\tau_{\\mathbb D},1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\operatorname{SameRiemannMapClass}_S(f,g,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S(f,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\land\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S(g,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{DiskAutomorphism}_S(\\alpha,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\land g=f\\circ\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\operatorname{SameRiemannMapClass}_S(f,g,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S(f,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\land\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S(g,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{DiskAutomorphism}_S(\\alpha,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\land g=f\\circ\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash \\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\tau_{\\mathbb C}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\land\n\\mathrm{Open}_S(\\Omega,\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\Omega\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\Omega\\neq\\mathbb C\n\\land\\exists\\tau_\\Omega\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_\\Omega,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S(f,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash \\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\tau_{\\mathbb C}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\land\n\\mathrm{Open}_S(\\Omega,\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\Omega\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\Omega\\neq\\mathbb C\n\\land\\exists\\tau_\\Omega\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_\\Omega,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(\\Omega,\\tau_\\Omega)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\operatorname{RiemannMap}_S(f,\\Omega,\\tau_{\\mathbb C}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient topology is an explicit predicate argument, while the disk and domain subspace topologies are bound witnesses; no map predicate depends on free topology variables.</li>\n<li>The exact seven-place biholomorphism signature is used.</li>\n<li>The exclusions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Omega=\\varnothing\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\mathbb C\">\\(\\Omega=\\mathbb C\\)</span> are essential.</li>\n<li>Boundary extension needs separate boundary hypotheses: a Jordan domain gives a homeomorphic extension to closures, while prime-end formulations cover more general simply connected domains.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahlfors, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, Functions of One Complex Variable</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d06636b21adf739","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head